From c56501bb5c807bd13a7b83b5b399791cc2df686c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhafron <zhafronadani@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 08:49:03 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] minuitwrp: use the legacy KMS drm backend

The atomic backend is written for Qualcomm SDE (layer mixers, SPR, SDE plane props). On Unisoc sprd_drm its init returns NULL without a message after creating both dumb buffers, gr_init falls back to fbdev (no /dev/graphics/fb0), and the GUI dereferences a NULL gr_draw at the first theme scaling, so recovery crash-loops on the boot logo. Each restart leaks two dumb buffers until sprd_drm refuses more. The legacy drmModeSetCrtc/drmModePageFlip backend is the one AOSP minui uses, which Lineage Recovery runs on this panel. Source: TeamWin android_bootable_recovery android-11 minuitwrp/graphics_drm.cpp.
---
 minuitwrp/graphics_drm.cpp | 1045 +++++++-----------------------------
 1 file changed, 194 insertions(+), 851 deletions(-)

